{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed dormer extension, by reasons of its siting and design, represents an uncharacteristic and unsympathetic addition that would disrupt the overall roofscape and appear unduly prominent and incongruent in design,&amp;nbsp;notably given the location of the application site within the Becontree Estate. As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Paragraph 126, 130, 134 of the National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;(DLUHC, July 2021);&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Policies D4 and HC1 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Policies CP2 and CP3 of the&amp;nbsp;Local Development Framework (LDF) Core Strategy (July 2010);&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Policies BP2, BP8 and BP11 of the&amp;nbsp;Local Development Framework (LDF) Borough Wide Development Plan Document (DPD) (March 2011);&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Paragraph 5.6.2 of the&amp;nbsp;Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012); and&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Policies SP2, DMD1, and DMD4&amp;nbsp; of&amp;nbsp;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Draft Local Plan 2037 (Regulation 19 Submission Version, December 2021).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;",
    "&lt;div&gt;The siting and design of the proposed development would result in a loss to the privacy of No.&amp;nbsp; 29 and No. 30 Spinney Gardens, therefore constituting unneighbourly development and contrary to:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;National Planning Policy Framework &lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(NPPF) (December, 2023)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Policy\r\nD4 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Policy\r\nCP3 of Local Development Framework (LDF) Core Strategy (July 2010)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Policies BP8 and BP11 of the Local Development Framework (LDF) Borough\r\nWide Development Plan Document (DPD) (March 2011)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Residential\r\nExtensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012);&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD6 of The London Borough of Barking and\r\nDagenham’s Draft Local Plan: (Regulation 19 Submission Version, December 2021)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;"
  ],
